<navigation-bar title="单项营养素趋势" back="{{false}}" color="#332724" background="transparent"><view slot="left" class="nav-back" bindtap="goBack">‹</view></navigation-bar><view class="page-shell"><view wx:if="{{reviewLabel}}" class="review">{{reviewLabel}}</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="sub">正在整理逐日记录…</view><view wx:if="{{errorMessage}}" class="card error">{{errorMessage}}<button class="button" bindtap="retry">重试</button></view><block wx:elif="{{!loading}}"><text class="eyebrow">{{startDate}} — {{endDate}}</text><view class="tabs"><view wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="key" id="nutrient-category-{{item.key}}" class="tab {{(showNutrientOptions?optionCategory:category)===item.key?'active':''}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="selectCategory">{{item.name}}</view></view><scroll-view wx:if="{{showNutrientOptions}}" id="nutrient-options" class="nutrient-options" scroll-x enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="nutrient-options-row"><view wx:for="{{visibleOptions}}" wx:key="code" id="nutrient-choice-{{item.code}}" class="nutrient-option {{nutrientCode===item.code?'active':''}}" data-code="{{item.code}}" bindtap="selectNutrient">{{item.name}}</view></view></scroll-view><view id="selected-nutrient-title" class="heading">{{name}}</view><text class="scope-note">仅显示已确认记录中的可计算量，不代表全天摄入。点击柱或日期查看当天。</text><view class="card"><view class="heading">逐日记录量<text class="link">{{unitText}}</text></view><text wx:for="{{lines}}" wx:key="label" class="line-label">虚线：{{item.label}} {{item.valueText}} {{unitText}}</text><text class="sub">{{referenceText}}</text><view class="chart"><view id="chart-axis" class="axis {{wideAxis?'wide-axis':''}}"><text wx:for="{{axisLabels}}" wx:key="key" class="axis-label {{item.reference?'reference-value':''}} {{item.alternate?'alternate':''}}" style="bottom:{{item.bottom}}%">{{item.text}}</text></view><view class="plot"><view wx:for="{{axisTicks}}" wx:key="key" class="axis-tick" style="bottom:{{item.bottom}}%"></view><view wx:for="{{lines}}" wx:key="label" class="ref-line" style="bottom:{{item.bottom}}%"></view><view class="columns"><view wx:for="{{bars}}" wx:key="date" class="column" data-report-id="{{item.reportId}}" bindtap="openDay"><text class="bar-value" style="bottom:{{item.height}}%;margin-bottom:8rpx">{{item.valueText}}</text><view class="bar {{item.tone}}" style="height:{{item.height}}%"></view></view></view></view></view><view class="dates {{wideAxis?'wide-dates':''}}"><text wx:for="{{bars}}" wx:key="date" class="date-label" data-report-id="{{item.reportId}}" bindtap="openDay">{{item.label}}</text></view><view id="chart-legend" class="chart-legend"><view class="legend-item"><view class="legend-swatch bar known"></view><text>可比较记录</text></view><view class="legend-item"><view class="legend-swatch bar partial"></view><text>部分已知</text></view><view class="legend-item"><view class="legend-swatch bar uncertain"></view><text>资料有限（已知量）</text></view><view class="legend-item"><text class="legend-symbol">—</text><text>无可计算数值</text></view><view class="legend-item"><text class="legend-symbol">0</text><text>真实0值</text></view><view wx:if="{{lines.length}}" class="legend-item reference-legend"><view class="legend-line"></view><text>一般参考线</text></view></view><text wx:if="{{lines.length > 1}}" class="legend-note">AI参考区间上端不是安全上限。</text></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">本项记录说明</view><text>{{description}}</text><text class="sub">{{comparableDays}}天可比较 · {{excludedDays}}天排除（合计7天）</text><text wx:if="{{comparableDays}}" class="sub">其中低于参考值{{lowDays}}天，达到或超过参考值{{nonLowDays}}天。部分已知达到仅作限定解释。</text><text wx:if="{{crossVersion}}" class="sub">逐日参考发生变化，已隐藏统一参考线。</text><view class="link" bindtap="toggleExclusions">{{showExclusions?'收起':'查看'}}排除日期与原因</view><view wx:if="{{showExclusions}}" wx:for="{{exclusions}}" wx:key="date" class="row" data-report-id="{{item.reportId}}" bindtap="openDay"><text class="row-title">{{item.date}} ›</text>{{item.text}}</view></view></block></view>